===Addons In Need of Fixes===
These addons work on normal 1.12 servers, but because of Turtle WoW's changes, these addons are known to suffer lua errors or other serious issues. If you are an addon developer and choose to fix up these addons, please share your fixed fork on the working addons list above.

*[https://github.com/SaxxonPike/Questie-Twow Questie] - A standalone Vanilla QuestHelper. Has far less features than the 2024 Classic version most people know. Completely lacks support for new Turtle quests and changes. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HeH_DHm1Ecg&t [Vid1]].
**Consider instead: pfQuest + pfQuest-turtle
*[https://github.com/ElvUI-Vanilla/ElvUI ElvUI] - Complete User Interface replacement and overhaul. This is an incomplete backport from later WoW versions. [https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/19589902/30231616-62e40f32-94f4-11e7-9712-a32f19719cd8.jpg [Img1]]
**Consider instead: pfUI + pfUI-turtle
*[https://github.com/PROXiCiDE/MacroExtender MacroExtender] - allows you to create conditional statement macros that are found in TBC+ and more [http://proxicide.github.io/MacroExtender/ [Read]]
**Consider instead: Roid-Macros
